  "content": "<h3><code>也可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fclean-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1bd96a\">Modrinth</span></a> 取得</code></h3><h1><strong>需要 Optifine 或&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f16436\"><a style=\"color:#f16436\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></span> 才能運作</strong></h1><hr><h2><strong>給 Continuity 使用者的注意事項</strong></h2><p>（請展開下方內容）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如果你在使用玻璃片時遇到以下問題，請務必啟用 Continuity 提供的「Glass Pane Culling Fix」資源包，並將其置於此資源包之上！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1763/256/glass-pane-culing-issue-img-png.png\" alt=\"Continuity 與玻璃片的問題\" width=\"45%\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1763/255/glass-pane-culing-issue-fix-png.png\" alt=\"為 Continuity 修復玻璃片剔除問題\" width=\"45%\"></p>\n</div><hr><h1><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為玻璃添加無條紋的連接紋理。就是這樣！</span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>此資源包會改變以下方塊：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>所有玻璃方塊</li>\n<li>所有玻璃片</li>\n<li>染色玻璃與玻璃片</li>\n</ul><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\">希望你喜歡！:D</span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clean-connected-glass/gallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f16436\">展示廳</span></a></span></span></h4>",
